hadiths[5]{hadithnumber,text}:
"223","[AI-translation] Aisha (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai jo Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki biwi hain, unhon-ne kaha: Ham Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key sath Aap key baaz safaron mein nikley yahan tak ke jab ham Baida ya Zaat-ul-Jaish mein they to mera haar toot gaya. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) usey talaash karney par thehar gaey aur log Aap key sath thehar gaey jabke wo paani par na they. To log Abu Bakr Siddique key paas aey aur unhon-ne kaha: Kya tum nahi dekhtey ke Aisha ne kya kya? Unhon-ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) aur logon ko rok diya jabke wo paani par nahi hain aur unkey paas paani nahi hai. To Abu Bakr aey jabke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne apna sar meri raan par rakkha hua tha aur so gaey they. To unhon-ne kaha: Tum ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) aur logon ko rok diya jabke wo paani par nahi hain aur unkey paas paani nahi hai. To Aisha ne kaha: To Abu Bakr ne mujhey malaamat ki aur jo Allah ne chaaha kaha aur apne haath se meri kokh mein chubhoney lagey. To mujhey harkat karney se sirf Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ka meri raan par honay ka maqaam rokta tha. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) subah key waqt uthay jabke paani na tha. To Allah ne Tayammum ki aayat naazil farmai aur unhon-ne tayammum kya. To Usaid bin Huzair ne kaha: Ye tumhari pehli barkat nahi hai ae Aale Abu Bakr! Unhon-ne kaha: To ham ne us oont ko uthaaya jis par main thi aur haar uskey neechey paaya. (Bukhari: 334)"
"224","[AI-translation] Jaabir bin Abdullah (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Mujhey paanch (cheezein) di gaein jo mujh se pehley kisi ko nahi di gaein: Mahiney bhar ki raah tak roab key sath meri madad ki gai. Aur merey liye zameen masjid aur paak karney wali bana di gai. To meri ummat mein se jo aadmi ho jisey namaz paa ley to use namaz padhni chaahiye. Aur merey liye maal-e-ganeemat halaal kiye gaey jabke mujh se pehley kisi key liye halaal na huey. Aur mujhey shafaat di gai. Aur Nabi apni qaum ki taraf khaas bhejey jaatey they aur main tamaam logon ki taraf bheja gaya hun. (Bukhari: 335)"
"225","[AI-translation] Abu Juhaim bin Haaris Ansaari (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) Beer-e-Jamal ki taraf se aey. To Aap ko aik aadmi mila aur us ne Aap ko salaam kya. To Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne use jawaab na diya yahan tak ke Aap deewar ki taraf aey. To apne chehrey aur haathon par (mitti) mali phir use jawaab diya. (Bukhari: 337)"
"226","[AI-translation] Ammaar bin Yaasir se riwayat hai ke unhon-ne Umar bin Khattab (Raziallahu anhu) se kaha: Kya tumhey yaad nahi ke ham safar mein they main aur tum. To tum ne to namaz na padhi aur main mitti mein lota phir namaz padhi. To main ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se zikr kya. To Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Beshak tumhey aisa kaafi tha. To Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne apni hatheliyon ko zameen par maara aur un mein phoonka, phir un donon se apna chehra aur apni hatheliyaan malein? (Bukhari: 338)"
"227","[AI-translation] Imraan bin Husain Khuzaai (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Ham Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key sath safar mein they aur beshak ham raat ko chaley yahan tak ke ham raat key aakhir mein they ke ham (so gaey) aur musaafir key paas us se zyada meethi neend nahi hoti. To hamein sooraj ki garmi key siwa kisi ne na jagaaya. Aur sab se pehley fulaan jaaga phir fulaan phir fulaan, phir chauthey Umar bin Khattab. Aur Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) jab sotey to jagaey na jaatey yahan tak ke Aap khud jaagtey, kyunke ham nahi jaantey they ke Aap ko aapki neend mein kya pesh aata hai. Phir jab Umar jaagey aur logon ko jo pahuncha tha dekha, aur wo mazboot aadmi they. To takbeer kahi aur takbeer mein aawaaz buland ki. To musalsal takbeer kehtey rahey aur takbeer mein aawaaz buland kartey rahey yahan tak ke unki aawaaz se Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) jaag gaey. Phir jab Aap jaagey to unhon-ne Aap se jo unhey pahuncha tha shikaayat ki. Aap ne farmaya: Koi harj nahi ya nuqsaan nahi, kooch karo. To Aap ne kooch kya aur thodi door chaley. Phir utrey aur wuzu (ka paani) manga aur wuzu kya. Aur namaz key liye pukaara gaya to Aap ne logon ko namaz padhaai. Phir jab Aap apni namaz se phirey to Aap ne aik aadmi ko alag dekha jis ne qaum key sath namaz na padhi thi. Aap ne farmaya: Ae fulaan! Tumhey qaum key sath namaz padhney se kis ne roka? Us ne kaha: Mujhey janaabat pahuncha hai aur paani nahi hai. Aap ne farmaya: Tum par mitti (se tayammum) laazim hai, beshak wo tumhey kaafi hai. Phir Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) chaley. To logon ne Aap se pyaas ki shikaayat ki. To Aap utrey aur fulaan ko bulaaya aur Ali ko bulaaya aur farmaya: Jao aur paani talaash karo. To wo donon chaley aur unhey aik aurat mili jo paani key do mashkizon ya do bartan key darmiyaan apne oont par thi. To un donon ne us se kaha: Paani kahaan hai? Us ne kaha: Mera paani se ahd kal is ghadi hua tha, aur hamaarey aadmi peechey reh gaey hain. Un donon ne us se kaha: Phir chalo. Us ne kaha: Kahaan? Un donon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki taraf. Us ne kaha: Wo jinhey Saaebi kaha jaata hai? Un donon ne kaha: Wahi hain jo tum keh rahi ho, to chalo. To wo donon usey Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key paas laaey aur unhon-ne Aap se hadees bayan ki. Aap ne farmaya: Use uskey oont se utaaro. Aur Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne bartan manga aur us mein donon mashkizon ya bartan key munhon se (paani) daala aur unkey munh baandh diye. Aur nalkey khol diye aur logon mein elaan kya gaya: Pilaao aur (jaanvaron ko) pilaao. To jis ne chaaha piya aur jis ne chaaha (jaanvaron ko) pilaaya. Aur uska aakhir ye tha ke Aap ne usey jisey janaabat pahuncha tha paani ka bartan diya. Aap ne farmaya: Jao aur use apne aap par bahaao. Aur wo (aurat) khadi dekh rahi thi ke uskey paani key sath kya kya jaa raha hai. Aur Allah ki qasam! Beshak us se (paani) khatm ho gaya tha jabke hamein gumaan hota tha ke wo us se zyada bhari hai jab us mein shuru kya gaya tha. To Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Uskey liye jama karo. To unhon-ne uskey liye khajooron aur aatey aur sattu mein se jama kya yahan tak ke uskey liye jama kar liya aur use kapdey mein rakkha. Aur use uskey oont par sawaar kya aur kapda uskey saamney rakkha. Aap ne us se kaha: Tum jaanti ho ke ham ne tumharey paani mein se kuchh kam nahi kya, lekin Allah hi hai jis ne hamein pilaaya hai. To wo apne ghar walon key paas aai jabke wo un se ruk gai thi. Unhon-ne kaha: Ae fulaana! Tumhey kis ne rok diya? Us ne kaha: Taajjub hai! Mujhey do aadmi milay aur wo mujhey uskey paas ley gaey jisey Saaebi kaha jaata hai. To us ne aisa aisa kya. To Allah ki qasam! Beshak wo is aur is key darmiyaan logon mein sab se bada jaadugar hai. Aur us ne apni darmiyaani aur shahaadat ki ungliyon se kaha aur unhey aasmaan ki taraf uthaaya, yaani aasmaan aur zameen. Ya beshak wo waqai Allah key Rasool hain. To uskey baad Musalman uskey gird mushrikeen par hamla kartey they aur us basti ko na pahunchety jis mein se wo thi. To us ne aik din apni qaum se kaha: Mera khayaal hai ke ye log tumhey jaan boojh kar chhorey huey hain. To kya tumharey liye Islam mein (daakhil honay mein bhalai) hai? To unhon-ne uski baat maani aur Islam mein daakhil ho gaey. (Bukhari: 344). Kitaab-us-Salaat."
